  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758548,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Step into the world of espionage with *James Bond 007: Nightfire* for the Game Boy Advance! As the iconic secret agent, embark on a thrilling mission to investigate a noted industrialist’s operations and uncover a plot to conquer the world using a powerful U.S. defense satellite. Featuring a storyline adapted for the handheld, this action-adventure game delivers a unique Bond experience on the go.\n\nNavigate ten challenging levels across exotic locales, from the Austrian Alps to the South Pacific, utilizing Bond’s signature gadgets and arsenal of real-world inspired weaponry. Experience a blend of first-person shooting, stealth, and puzzle-solving gameplay as you engage in intense shootouts and covert operations. \n\nWhile the GBA version features modifications compared to the console releases, it retains the core essence of the James Bond universe. Challenge friends in multiplayer mode and immerse yourself in a captivating spy adventure. Prepare for thrilling action and save the world, Agent 007!"
    },
